 "notes": "SIGNATURE. Its chain alternates high and low thrusts, so it plays around a shield's height rather than its edges — the only weapon in the class that makes a turtle move its guard.\n\nLineage: duelist — Imperial duelling grip: side-on, deeper retraction, the point held higher between thrusts.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 33.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
